  "body_html": "<h1>min_over_z</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem min_over_z (x y : ℝ) (hx0 : 0 ≤ x) (hx1 : x ≤ 1) (hy0 : 0 ≤ y) (hy1 : y ≤ 1) : ∀ z, 0 ≤ z → z ≤ 1 → min (x * y) ((1 - x) * (1 - y)) ≤ G x y z</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>none</li>\n</ul>",
